Cryptography for witos (plan step R4.1, RFC 0015 section 8): the system layer has no OpenSSL, so the unix flavour built
for TargetOS=witos takes the set the browser builds instead of the OpenSSL one: System.Native's random bytes, the
managed SHA hashes, HMAC, HKDF, PBKDF2 and SP 800-108, and PlatformNotSupportedException for every other algorithm and
for X.509, until a provider is decided with the storage of keys and the network.

--- a/src/libraries/System.Security.Cryptography/src/System.Security.Cryptography.csproj
